pageType: content
notes: |
  合规页：研究、教育、决策支持工具；不荐股、不代下单、不承诺收益。每条边界对应产品铁律。
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: watermark
    elementType: text
    bounds: [770, 24, 130, 104]
    content:
      style: "$watermark"
      align: [right, top]
      text: "15"
  - elementId: kicker-tick
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 17, 14, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [82, 10, 460, 16]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      text: COMPLIANCE · 14
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 34, 840, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 研究 / 教育 / 决策支持工具：不荐股、不代下单、不承诺收益
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 86, 840, 18]
    content:
      style: "$sub"
      text: 合规边界与产品铁律一一对应（SFC Type 1/4/9 牌照边界内）
  - elementId: comp-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 120, 840, 264]
    style: "$default"
    columnWidths: [0.3, 0.7]
    rowHeights: [0.08, 0.184, 0.184, 0.184, 0.184, 0.184]
    rows:
      - - text: 边界
        - text: 对应铁律
      - - text: 投资建议边界
        - text: 页面与材料声明非投资建议，无荐股表达、无收益承诺
      - - text: 实盘风险
        - text: 比赛版本无实盘入口，不注册真实交易权限
      - - text: 模拟误操作
        - text: 独立确认 + 提交前复核 + 幂等；禁止自动重提、补腿、追价
      - - text: 数据授权
        - text: 授权行情与原始快照不重新分发；公开材料脱敏
      - - text: LLM 幻觉
        - text: 数值引擎 + 审计链兜底；LLM 只做解析、编排与解释
  - elementId: quote-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 396, 840, 34]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primaryA"}
  - elementId: quote-rail
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 396, 4, 34]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: quote-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [74, 402, 40, 12]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      text: 金句
  - elementId: quote-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [118, 401, 770, 22]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      text: 合规不是免责声明，是产品边界。
  - elementId: takeaway
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 438, 840, 54]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$deep"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: takeaway-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 452, 804, 28]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 11
      text: PASS 的含义是「当前数据、规则与风险门通过」，不代表盈利、成交或投资建议。
  - elementId: footer-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 518, 840, 1]
    viewBox: [840, 1]
    points: "0,0 840,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 520, 600, 14]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      text: 来源：research/03-boundaries-risks.md · docs/PRD.md §2.3 非目标
  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 520, 200, 14]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      align: [right, top]
      text: 15 / 16
